 "rounding": {
  "what": "One site rounds the zoom it writes. Bing's wheel moves a third of a level and its URL carries one decimal, so \"15.3\" is really 15.334 \u2014 a fortieth of a level, two and a third percent of scale, five metres at the edge of a 1600 px window at level 18.",
